;; typing/typemod.ml (structures, signatures, module expressions and types, functors and their applications with
;; applicative paths, include, open, with-constraints), typing/includemod.ml (the inclusion of module types and
;; its coercions) and typing/mtype.ml's parts env.ae does not hold, for what doc/ocaml/TYPER.md's T8 names, whose
;; notices follow (LICENSE.md, "The OCaml Core System"):
;;
;;                                 OCaml
;;
